"We build today while protecting resources for future generations, through environmental responsibility and resource efficiency."},{"lines":["Delivering","quality"],"text":"Built to last. From certified batching to precision placement, laboratory quality control ensures every structure remains strong, durable and enduring."},{"lines":["Building","trust"],"text":"Stronger together. We grow alongside our clients, partners and suppliers through long-term relationships built on trust, respect and mutual success."}]},"projects":{"titleLines":["Selected","Projects"],"ctaLabel":"See all projects","ctaHref":"/?projects"},"coverage":{"titleLines":["Everywhere You Build,","We’ve Got You Covered."],"image":"/Image/bce/about-business-banner.webp","imageAlt":"BCE engineers and crew on a concrete slab in Cambodia","intro":"We go where you build. With strong equipment capacity, experienced teams and reliable coordination, we support projects across 13 provinces and Phnom Penh.","hint":"Click on a province to see more details","story":[{"label":"Operational coverage","lead":"Locations covered across Cambodia"},{"label":"Years of experience","lead":"Building from Battambang since 1995"},{"label":"Completed projects","lead":"Projects completed in 2025 across Cambodia"},{"label":"Equipment fleet","lead":"Machines in our own fleet"}],"fleetNote":"Plus our own piling rigs.","credit":"Boundaries © OpenStreetMap contributors · Completed projects across Cambodia"},"why":{"eyebrow":"Why choose BCE","beliefs":[{"word":"Quality","tag":"Tested at every stage"},{"word":"Capacity","tag":"Our own plants and fleet"},{"word":"Trust","tag":"Partners for the long term"}]},"quote":{"image":"/Image/bce/hero_batching_plant.webp","title":"Planning a project? Request a quotation.","text":"Tell us your site, scope and schedule for ready-mix concrete, piling, construction, slab works or equipment rental. Our engineers will send a clear quotation from our own plants and fleet.","ctaLabel":"Request a quotation","ctaHref":"/?quote"},"footer":{"columns":[{"title":"Company","links":[{"label":"Home","href":"#"},{"label":"About BCE","href":"/?about"},{"label":"Projects","href":"/?projects"},{"label":"Blog & Insights","href":"/?blog"},{"label":"Coverage","href":"/?coverage"},{"label":"Resources & Downloads","href":"/?resources"}]},{"title":"Our businesses","links":[{"label":"Ready-Mix Concrete","href":"/?business=ready-mix-concrete"},{"label":"Piling","href":"/?business=piling"},{"label":"Construction","href":"/?business=construction"},{"label":"Concrete Slab Works","href":"/?business=concrete-slab-works"},{"label":"Truck & Equipment Rental","href":"/?business=equipment-rental"}]},{"title":"Capabilities","links":[{"label":"Quality & capability","href":"/?quality"},{"label":"Laboratory","href":"/?quality#laboratory"},{"label":"Equipment & fleet","href":"/?quality#equipment-fleet"},{"label":"Coverage","href":"/?coverage"}]},{"title":"Work with us","links":[{"label":"Request a quote","href":"/?quote"},{"label":"Careers & Recruitment","href":"/?recruitment"},{"label":"Contact us","href":"/?contact"},{"label":"Hire our equipment","href":"/?quote&service=equipment-rental"},{"label":"Get directions","href":"MAPS"}]}],"enquiryTitle":"Talk to us about your project","enquiryText":"Tell us your site, scope and schedule. Our engineers will review it and come back with a clear, detailed quotation, supplied from our own plants and fleet.","primaryLabel":"Request a quote","primaryHref":"/?quote","callLabel":"Call for a Quotation","officeTitle":"Battambang · Head office","hotlinesLabel":"Sales & Quotations Hotlines","socialLabel":"Social & Direct Contact","directionsLabel":"Get directions","backToTopLabel":"Back to top","rightsLabel":"All rights reserved"},"title":"Homepage","slug":"home"}', '2026-11-17T03:33:41.127Z', '2026-11-17T03:33:41.127Z', 'seed')
